{"title":"Welcome!","uid":"447543686161755d1d0ef6097e7f563d","slug":"Welcome","date":"2025-05-06T16:00:00.000Z","updated":"2025-06-12T23:01:41.947Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/Welcome.json","keywords":null,"cover":"/images/logo.png","content":"<p>Welcome to <a href=\"https://guanxuwang-files.github.io/\">MyBrain</a>! 欢迎来到我的知识库！如果你能来到这里，就说明你可以在这里找到你想要的资料。</p>\n<p>原来的网页将不再进行更新和维护，只作为文件的储存空间，未来的一切资料都将在这里更新。期待您的评论提出的建议！</p>\n<div class=\"custom-quote danger\">\n<span class=\"custom-quote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M19.76 5.23C15.84 5.23 12 2 12 2C12 2 8.15996 5.23 4.23996 5.23C4.23996 5.23 1.86996 16.99 12 22C22.13 16.99 19.76 5.23 19.76 5.23Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M12 8V13\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M11.99 16H12\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span>\n<p class=\"custom-quote-title\">Hexo Commands</p>\n<p><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"center\">Commands</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Explanations</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code>clean</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Remove generated files and cache.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code>deploy</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Deploy your website.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code>generate</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Generate static files.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code>server</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Start the server.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>网页预览（启动服务器）：<code>hexo server</code> 或 <code>hexo s</code>；</p>\n<!-- http://localhost:4000/ -->\n<p>清理静态文件缓存：<code>hexo clean</code> 或 <code>hexo cl</code>；</p>\n<p>生成静态文件：<code>hexo generate</code> 或 <code>hexo g</code>；</p>\n<p>部署网站页面：<code>hexo deploy</code> 或 <code>hexo d</code>。</p>\n<p>一套丝滑小连招：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">hexo cl &amp;&amp; hexo g &amp;&amp; hexo d</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n</p>\n</div>\n","feature":true,"text":"Welcome to MyBrain!...","permalink":"/post/Welcome","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":478,"symbolsTime":"1 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"Welcome","slug":"Welcome","count":1,"path":"api/categories/Welcome.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Welcome","slug":"Welcome","count":1,"path":"api/tags/Welcome.json"}],"toc":"","author":{"name":"王观旭","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"/images/avatar.png","link":"https://guanxuwang.github.io","description":"<p>真理所在之处，数学生生不息。</p>The learning materials throughout my life.","socials":{"github":"https://github.com/guanxuwang","twitter":"","stackoverflow":"","wechat":"","qq":"","weibo":"","zhihu":"https://www.zhihu.com/people/wang-guan-xu-96","csdn":"https://blog.csdn.net/GuanxuWANG","juejin":"","customs":{"bilibili":{"icon":"/svg/bilibili.svg","link":"https://space.bilibili.com/23972352"},"mail":{"icon":"/svg/mail.svg","link":"mailto:wanggx11174@163.com"},"wechat-pay":{"icon":"/svg/wechat-pay.svg","link":"/svg/wechat-pay.JPG"}}}},"mapped":true,"hidden":false,"prev_post":{"title":"Generalised Linear Models","uid":"323acb7bb21b7c66607f842352069cd1","slug":"广义线性模型","date":"2025-05-07T16:00:00.000Z","updated":"2025-06-17T19:45:06.069Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/广义线性模型.json","keywords":null,"cover":"/images/cover/GLM.jpg","text":"STATS5019 广义线性模型 (University of Glasgow, UK)...","permalink":"/post/广义线性模型","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"13k","symbolsTime":"12 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"Notes","slug":"Notes","count":2,"path":"api/categories/Notes.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Postgraduate","slug":"Postgraduate","count":3,"path":"api/tags/Postgraduate.json"}],"author":{"name":"王观旭","slug":"blog-a